    "narrative": "The Zurich Zebras enter today\u2019s slate prioritizing stolen base upside and favorable matchups against back-end starters. **Pete Crow-Armstrong** (80.98) is our primary engine today; his matchup against Lowder is bolstered by a 14% platoon edge and, crucially, a slow pitcher delivery that significantly boosts his stolen base expectation, making him an elite start at the top of the order. **Christian Yelich** (75.84) and **Yordan Alvarez** (70.25) provide the high-ceiling production we need, with **Christian Yelich** benefiting from a soft matchup against Brandon Young and **Yordan Alvarez** remaining a mandatory start despite a neutral L/L platoon due to his elite xwOBA. **Trea Turner** (63.27) and **Junior Caminero** (62.79) round out our high-efficiency core, with **Trea Turner** retaining value despite a marginal park penalty because his sprint speed remains the cornerstone of our strategy.\n\nWe are navigating a few high-stakes matchups, most notably against deGrom, which compresses the floors for **Kazuma Okamoto** (41.77) and **Josh Smith** (41.76). These two are barely clearing our 40.0 floor; while both have favorable platoon dynamics, the elite SP skill of their opponent makes them high-variance plays. **Carson Benge** was the toughest omission from the starting nine, finishing at 35.11. While his base projection was solid, he was ultimately benched because his matchup against a sub-3.00 xERA pitcher, combined with a negative platoon split, failed to meet our aggressive efficiency requirements. We are closely monitoring the lineup statuses for **Gary Sanchez** and **Christian Encarnacion-Strand**; should these \"Lineup Pending\" designations shift toward lower-order assignments, their efficiency scores will face downward pressure, though they are expected to remain in the starting nine regardless. Our depth remains challenged by the absences of **Colt Keith**, **Casey Schmitt**, and **Dillon Dingler**, forcing us to rely heavily on our current starters to maintain our 5x5 Roto positioning.",
